{
  "id": "HOS.7",
  "number": "7",
  "bookId": "HOS",
  "reference": "Hosea 7",
  "verseCount": 16,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "7",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "HOS 7"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "7",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 7:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When I would heal Israel, then is the iniquity of Ephraim uncovered, and the wickedness of Samaria; for they commit falsehood, and the thief entereth in, and the troop of robbers ravageth without. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.7.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 7:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And they consider not in their hearts that I remember all their wickedness: now have their own doings beset them about; they are before my face. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.7.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.7.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 7:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They make the king glad with their wickedness, and the princes with their lies. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.7.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 7:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They are all adulterers; they are as an oven heated by the baker; he ceaseth to stir ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.7.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.7.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", from the kneading of the dough, until it be leavened. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.7.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.7.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 7:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "On the day of our king the princes made themselves sick with the heat of wine; he stretched out his hand with scoffers. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.7.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.7.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 7:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For they have made ready their heart like an oven, while they lie in wait: their baker sleepeth all the night; in the morning it burneth as a flaming fire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.7.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.7.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 7:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They are all hot as an oven, and devour their judges; all their kings are fallen: there is none among them that calleth unto me.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.7.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.7.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 7:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.7.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.7.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 7:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ephraim, he mixeth himself among the peoples; Ephraim is a cake not turned. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.7.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.7.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 7:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Strangers have devoured his strength, and he knoweth ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.7.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.7.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " not: yea, gray hairs are here and there upon him, and he knoweth ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.7.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.7.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " not. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.7.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.7.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 7:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the pride of Israel doth testify to his face: yet they have not returned unto Jehovah their God, nor sought him, for all this. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.7.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.7.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 7:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Ephraim is like a silly dove, without understanding: they call unto Egypt, they go to Assyria. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.7.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.7.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 7:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When they shall go, I will spread my net upon them; I will bring them down as the birds of the heavens; I will chastise them, as their congregation hath heard. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.7.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.7.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 7:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Woe unto them! for they have wandered from me; destruction unto them! for they have trespassed against me: though I would redeem them, yet they have spoken lies against me. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.7.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.7.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 7:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And they have not cried unto me with their heart, but they howl upon their beds: they assemble themselves for grain and new wine; they rebel against me. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.7.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.7.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 7:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Though I have taught and strengthened their arms, yet do they devise mischief against me. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.7.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.7.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 7:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They return, but not to ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.7.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.7.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " on high; they are like a deceitful bow; their princes shall fall by the sword for the rage of their tongue: this shall be their derision in the land of Egypt.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.7.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.7.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
